{"title": "Cattle Prattle (Condition)", "pageid": 28027, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cattle_Prattle_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cattle Prattle Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Cattle Prattle</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Want to converse like a cow? Dolly Thrice will show you how. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\