=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Polymorph\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Polymorph\">SG_Polymorph</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Polymorph_BeastShape\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Polymorph BeastShape\">SG_Polymorph_BeastShape</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_DropForNonMutingDialog\" title=\"SG DropForNonMutingDialog\">SG_DropForNonMutingDialog</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Creature:_Deep_Roth.C3.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Deep_Rothé\">Creature: Deep Rothé</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deep_Roth%C3%A9\" title=\"Deep Rothé\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Portrait_Deep_Roth%C3%A9.png/120px-Portrait_Deep_Roth%C3%A9.png.webp, /w/images/f/fd/Portrait_Deep_Roth%C3%A9.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Portrait_Deep_Roth%C3%A9.png/120px-Portrait_Deep_Roth%C3%A9.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Portrait_Deep_Roth%C3%A9.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deep_Roth%C3%A9\" title=\"Deep Rothé\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>18</span></b></div> <span>(+4)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>10</span></b></div> \n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>14</span></b></div> <span>(+2)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>13</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>10</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/36px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>Large</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights_(Deep_Roth%C3%A9)\" title=\"Dancing Lights (Deep Rothé)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/40px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/60px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/80px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Lights\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/40px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights_(Deep_Roth%C3%A9)\" title=\"Dancing Lights (Deep Rothé)\">Dancing Lights</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Illuminate a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span> 9 m / 30 ft radius. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Charge\" title=\"Frenzied Charge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/40px-Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/60px-Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/80px-Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzied Charge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/40px-Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Charge_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Charge\" title=\"Frenzied Charge\">Frenzied Charge</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Charge forward, attacking all enemies in the way and pushing them back 3 m / 10 ft. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gore_(Deep_Roth%C3%A9)\" title=\"Gore (Deep Rothé)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/40px-Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/60px-Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/80px-Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gore\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp/40px-Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Gore_Deep_Roth%C3%A9_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gore_(Deep_Roth%C3%A9)\" title=\"Gore (Deep Rothé)\">Gore</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Impale a target </dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A character with this condition will always be able to teleport to <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Sigil_Circle\" title=\"Ancient Sigil Circle\">waypoints</a>, even if they are currently in an area where the map is outlined red.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Cattle_Prattle\">Sources of Cattle Prattle</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\">Filigreed Feywild Bell</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>POLYMORPH</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Dire Wolf</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Dire Wolf in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Minotaur\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Minotaur_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Minotaur_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Minotaur</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Minotaur in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Phase Spider</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Phase Spider in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Shadow Mastiff in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Big_Pig\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Pig_(Condition)\" title=\"Big Pig (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Big Pig\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Pig_(Condition)\" title=\"Big Pig (Condition)\">Big Pig</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Pigs are smart and pigs are fun - that's why Dolly made you one!</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Cattle_Prattle\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cattle_Prattle_(Condition)\" title=\"Cattle Prattle (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cattle Prattle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cattle Prattle</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Want to converse like a cow? Dolly Thrice will show you how.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorph\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph (Condition)\">Polymorph</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You are now a particularly ripe wheel of cheese, unpleasant to the nostril.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorph_Self\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph Self (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph Self (Condition)\">Polymorph Self</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a blue jay, able to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/38px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/50px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\">Fly</a> for 5 rounds.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorphed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature is turned into a harmless sheep with 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> for 5 turns.</li>\n<li>If the sheep's Hit Points are reduced to 0, the creature reverts to its original form with its original Hit Points.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorphed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Changed into a beast.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Toad_Mode\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toad_Mode_(Condition)\" title=\"Toad Mode (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toad Mode\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Toad_Mode_(Condition)\" title=\"Toad Mode (Condition)\">Toad Mode</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>If you do not want to think, Dolly Thrice will make you shrink.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202126\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.126 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5657/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 79341/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14532/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.074/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1655827/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  108.462      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%  108.462      1 -total\n 26.56%   28.809      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 23.59%   25.589     18 Template:Icon_text\n 19.90%   21.583     52 Template:Trim\n 17.74%   19.244     13 Template:Icon_link\n 16.72%   18.137      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 15.85%   17.189     11 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 10.35%   11.225      1 Template:Creature\n 10.26%   11.125      4 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28027-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202126 and revision id 378730. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}